(4828417, 699588, 56275, '<td valign="top">Focal point of this shot seems to be the burner, rather than the food. I see that you wanted to get the flame in the shot.. maybe tilting the pan towards the camera would get the best of both worlds?</td>', 'Focal point of this shot seems to be the burner, rather than the food. I see that you wanted to get the flame in the shot.. maybe tilting the pan towards the camera would get the best of both worlds?', '2008-07-16 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
