(4828467, 699438, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love the detail and colors in this food photo. Lighting is absolutely spot on with illuminating your subject such that it is appealing to the eye. Composition is also nice with the point of the plate and the food seemingly coming at you at the diagonal. Great job 9.</td>', 'Wow! Love the detail and colors in this food photo. Lighting is absolutely spot on with illuminating your subject such that it is appealing to the eye. Composition is also nice with the point of the plate and the food seemingly coming at you at the diagonal. Great job 9.', '2008-07-16 10:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
