(4828539, 699248, 43463, '<td valign="top">Food presentation is wonderful - composition is great. Colors are superb and lighting really illuminates your subject well such that the viewer can fully appreciate/taste your salad. Focus is wonderful as well with many lovely details that can be seen in the eggs, tomatoes, and greens. Great job on this one 8.</td>', 'Food presentation is wonderful - composition is great. Colors are superb and lighting really illuminates your subject well such that the viewer can fully appreciate/taste your salad. Focus is wonderful as well with many lovely details that can be seen in the eggs, tomatoes, and greens. Great job on this one 8.', '2008-07-16 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828540, 698353, 56275, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice in framing. Good colors and lighting of the food.. wish there wasn''t a double shadow from the plate though.</td>', 'Interesting choice in framing. Good colors and lighting of the food.. wish there wasn''t a double shadow from the plate though.', '2008-07-16 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828545, 699275, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can absolutely see your reasoning to match the colour and texture of the backdrop to the vivid red of the dish here but for me, it''s just too much. What with the red of the strawberry on the slice and within the slice and of the sauce, it''s just too much. Perhaps if it were on a plain plate without the sauce I''d keep the red fabric backdrop but otherwise, I''d say, something plainer. But that''s just my preference.</td>', 'I can absolutely see your reasoning to match the colour and texture of the backdrop to the vivid red of the dish here but for me, it''s just too much. What with the red of the strawberry on the slice and within the slice and of the sauce, it''s just too much. Perhaps if it were on a plain plate without the sauce I''d keep the red fabric backdrop but otherwise, I''d say, something plainer. But that''s just my preference.', '2008-07-16 11:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828547, 698611, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hmmm looks delicious! I don''t like the distortion from the lens though that''s putting the mug at that angle and also making it seem larger at the top.</td>', 'Hmmm looks delicious! I don''t like the distortion from the lens though that''s putting the mug at that angle and also making it seem larger at the top.', '2008-07-16 11:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828548, 699321, 56275, '<td valign="top">Irene? =)  Great shot. I experimented with some liquid action shots like this, and can really appreciate how difficult and time consuming it is to get such an amazing shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Irene? =)  Great shot. I experimented with some liquid action shots like this, and can really appreciate how difficult and time consuming it is to get such an amazing shot. Nicely done.', '2008-07-16 11:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828549, 699678, 3087, '<td valign="top">But where is it? Can only see the cream and the cherry but what about all that sundae goodness?</td>', 'But where is it? Can only see the cream and the cherry but what about all that sundae goodness?', '2008-07-16 11:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828552, 699698, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like that motion blur effect but the composition/ subject I do.</td>', 'Not sure I like that motion blur effect but the composition/ subject I do.', '2008-07-16 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828555, 698262, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely plated up, lovely clean plate, great colours and textures, looks delish!</td>', 'Nicely plated up, lovely clean plate, great colours and textures, looks delish!', '2008-07-16 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828557, 699607, 59029, '<td valign="top">Too much glare off frying pan.  Good idea and angle but lighting needs a little work.  The camera-mounted flash is not your friend!</td>', 'Too much glare off frying pan.  Good idea and angle but lighting needs a little work.  The camera-mounted flash is not your friend!', '2008-07-16 11:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828559, 698691, 56275, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The lighting and colors are great. Not to mention a unique take on onion rings. Well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The lighting and colors are great. Not to mention a unique take on onion rings. Well done.', '2008-07-16 11:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828560, 699422, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the black crockery and the side angle but, it does mean I can''t see that miso soup at all.</td>', 'I like the black crockery and the side angle but, it does mean I can''t see that miso soup at all.', '2008-07-16 11:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828561, 699580, 59029, '<td valign="top">very nice shot and making me hungry, but I''d like to see a little more sat.  Also risky with so much white-on-white.  Would like to see the sushi pop more.</td>', 'very nice shot and making me hungry, but I''d like to see a little more sat.  Also risky with so much white-on-white.  Would like to see the sushi pop more.', '2008-07-16 11:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828563, 699646, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! The colors and the details are really stand out fabulous! Lighting is excellent and I love the ''steam'' rising from the bottom - I STILL have not figured out to effectively capture smoke in my photos. Kudos to you for capturing it so well in this photo. Love how the colors and textures of the salad sticks really pops visually off the black background. Your composition of elements is not only eye appealing because of the bold colors but interesting because of the textures we see in the baby corns, asparagus and celery. (out of curiosity, don''t know exactly what the white salad stick is Jicama is a guess). Good lighting, good focus, good composition of elements 8.</td>', 'Wow! The colors and the details are really stand out fabulous! Lighting is excellent and I love the ''steam'' rising from the bottom - I STILL have not figured out to effectively capture smoke in my photos. Kudos to you for capturing it so well in this photo. Love how the colors and textures of the salad sticks really pops visually off the black background. Your composition of elements is not only eye appealing because of the bold colors but interesting because of the textures we see in the baby corns, asparagus and celery. (out of curiosity, don''t know exactly what the white salad stick is Jicama is a guess). Good lighting, good focus, good composition of elements 8.', '2008-07-16 11:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828565, 699536, 3087, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit dark and flat in terms of lighting. The meal itself looks nice but the pistachio pieces aren''t ideal photographically as they just make it look messy. Also, whose finger is that at the top?! Crop it out!Also not keen on the way the ice-cream blocks the view of the spoon breaking up it''s clean lines.</td>', 'Seems a bit dark and flat in terms of lighting. The meal itself looks nice but the pistachio pieces aren''t ideal photographically as they just make it look messy. Also, whose finger is that at the top?! Crop it out!Also not keen on the way the ice-cream blocks the view of the spoon breaking up it''s clean lines.', '2008-07-16 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828566, 699349, 59029, '<td valign="top">Lovely saturation and compostition and DAMN that looks good! 7</td>', 'Lovely saturation and compostition and DAMN that looks good! 7', '2008-07-16 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828567, 699705, 3087, '<td valign="top">Way too much detail and colour in the plate to allow focus on the food which is a shame as I think it would look rather elegant on a nice plate.</td>', 'Way too much detail and colour in the plate to allow focus on the food which is a shame as I think it would look rather elegant on a nice plate.', '2008-07-16 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828568, 699687, 45857, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this just doesn''t look appetizing, and I''m sure it should be.<br/>Several things, the burger blends into the charred bun, perhaps a little more side lighting would help; the cheese looks greasey,I think its the reflections; and the unbalanced top doesn''t work for me from this angle, if it was rotated to the back a bit more it would emphasize the size of the burger better. I do like the low angle and the framing, its just the little things.  6</td>', 'Sorry, but this just doesn''t look appetizing, and I''m sure it should be.Several things, the burger blends into the charred bun, perhaps a little more side lighting would help; the cheese looks greasey,I think its the reflections; and the unbalanced top doesn''t work for me from this angle, if it was rotated to the back a bit more it would emphasize the size of the burger better. I do like the low angle and the framing, its just the little things.  6', '2008-07-16 11:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828569, 698065, 59029, '<td valign="top">Like the comp, maybe colours a tiny bit dark, olives lost a little in bg.</td>', 'Like the comp, maybe colours a tiny bit dark, olives lost a little in bg.', '2008-07-16 11:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828570, 699512, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting with lots of shadows.</td>', 'I like the lighting with lots of shadows.', '2008-07-16 11:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828573, 699644, 59029, '<td valign="top">good shot and use of thirds, but would like to see what it looks like lit from the front.</td>', 'good shot and use of thirds, but would like to see what it looks like lit from the front.', '2008-07-16 11:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828576, 699566, 3087, '<td valign="top">Eeeek. It''s hard to even look away from that garish tablecloth to really focus on the soup and roll. Shooting it on a plain cloth or just on the table surface itself may have worked better.</td>', 'Eeeek. It''s hard to even look away from that garish tablecloth to really focus on the soup and roll. Shooting it on a plain cloth or just on the table surface itself may have worked better.', '2008-07-16 11:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828577, 699621, 59029, '<td valign="top">colurs good, slightly oof, tilt a little off-putting, would like to see some hunks of chicken poking out too.</td>', 'colurs good, slightly oof, tilt a little off-putting, would like to see some hunks of chicken poking out too.', '2008-07-16 11:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828584, 699555, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh that looks great. I really like your choice of crockery as that allows the focus to be on the food whilst also providing a compositional tool and some nice shapes. I also like the use of both square and round dishes and your off-centred composition. All good really!</td>', 'Oooh that looks great. I really like your choice of crockery as that allows the focus to be on the food whilst also providing a compositional tool and some nice shapes. I also like the use of both square and round dishes and your off-centred composition. All good really!', '2008-07-16 11:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828590, 699604, 59029, '<td valign="top">lovely, elegant bokeh.  I would''ve tried to use a silver spoon or one of brushed metal, though, the plastic spoon takes away a bit.</td>', 'lovely, elegant bokeh.  I would''ve tried to use a silver spoon or one of brushed metal, though, the plastic spoon takes away a bit.', '2008-07-16 11:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828593, 699021, 59029, '<td valign="top">the chocolate drip could be a little more alluring, but the rest of the shot is nicely composed.  Maybe bump up colours a little.</td>', 'the chocolate drip could be a little more alluring, but the rest of the shot is nicely composed.  Maybe bump up colours a little.', '2008-07-16 11:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828596, 699466, 59029, '<td valign="top">sick!  but funny too and nice comp. 7 for making me laugh even if it did kill my appetite! :-)</td>', 'sick!  but funny too and nice comp. 7 for making me laugh even if it did kill my appetite! :-)', '2008-07-16 11:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828598, 699616, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love how you''ve included the ingredients behind. I''m not too sure about the choice of the plate - I think the design detracts from the dish itself - but at least the yellow goes with the tarte filling and the blue with the dish in the backgound.</td>', 'I love how you''ve included the ingredients behind. I''m not too sure about the choice of the plate - I think the design detracts from the dish itself - but at least the yellow goes with the tarte filling and the blue with the dish in the backgound.', '2008-07-16 11:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828601, 699614, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF and the strong contrast. I think the angle is just that little too much.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF and the strong contrast. I think the angle is just that little too much.', '2008-07-16 11:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828602, 699566, 59029, '<td valign="top">careful...very goopd idea but the vivid tablecloth dominates the shot, not the food.  Also fill bowl with more soup.  Good attempt though!</td>', 'careful...very goopd idea but the vivid tablecloth dominates the shot, not the food.  Also fill bowl with more soup.  Good attempt though!', '2008-07-16 11:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828605, 698691, 45857, '<td valign="top">nice macro study, but I don''t get a feel for the dish.<br/>Its a single ingredient, it doesn''t say what it will become.<br/>Its a 6 , but could have been an 8.</td>', 'nice macro study, but I don''t get a feel for the dish.Its a single ingredient, it doesn''t say what it will become.Its a 6 , but could have been an 8.', '2008-07-16 11:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828606, 699476, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I like the simple presentation. I think lighting is a bit flat, perhaps needs to be warmer or warmed in post-processing. And perhaps show a little less of the lace tablecloth.</td>', 'Beautiful, I like the simple presentation. I think lighting is a bit flat, perhaps needs to be warmer or warmed in post-processing. And perhaps show a little less of the lace tablecloth.', '2008-07-16 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828608, 699618, 59029, '<td valign="top">I like the absence of the other diner!  more of a product shot than true foodie shot imho.</td>', 'I like the absence of the other diner!  more of a product shot than true foodie shot imho.', '2008-07-16 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828609, 699631, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the way you use the stems of the cherries to create sweeping curves/ parallels. Wonderfully simple and yet composition works well as do bright colours.</td>', 'Love the way you use the stems of the cherries to create sweeping curves/ parallels. Wonderfully simple and yet composition works well as do bright colours.', '2008-07-16 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4828610, 699510, 59029, '<td valign="top">you may get dinged for the bokeh but I think it works, and the plate''s colours don''t overtake the food. 7</td>', 'you may get dinged for the bokeh but I think it works, and the plate''s colours don''t overtake the food. 7', '2008-07-16 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828612, 698698, 59029, '<td valign="top">nice reversal of a traditional idea, very simple and effective. 8</td>', 'nice reversal of a traditional idea, very simple and effective. 8', '2008-07-16 11:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828613, 699438, 45857, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, but my eye really wants the parsley sharper and the salmon pinker.</td>', 'Like the composition, but my eye really wants the parsley sharper and the salmon pinker.', '2008-07-16 11:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828615, 698082, 3087, '<td valign="top">That tofu looks great but... I''m afraid that plate really, really detracts from it. I''d say presenting the beautiful bright tofu (and it''s bed of bright green lettuce) on a plain white plate with perhaps a pair of plain black chopsticks or a very plainly designed spoon would work better than the plate and spoon used here.</td>', 'That tofu looks great but... I''m afraid that plate really, really detracts from it. I''d say presenting the beautiful bright tofu (and it''s bed of bright green lettuce) on a plain white plate with perhaps a pair of plain black chopsticks or a very plainly designed spoon would work better than the plate and spoon used here.', '2008-07-16 11:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828617, 699680, 59029, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great ingredients presentation, but the avocado shows a bruise in the flesh, the onion dice gets lost in the fg.  I''d have had a bigger bowl of the guacamole and everything else playing second fiddle to it, here you have to look for it.</td>', 'Good idea, great ingredients presentation, but the avocado shows a bruise in the flesh, the onion dice gets lost in the fg.  I''d have had a bigger bowl of the guacamole and everything else playing second fiddle to it, here you have to look for it.', '2008-07-16 11:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828619, 699604, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the scene you have set with the chair and framed image in the background. The plate feels too close to the edge of the image though, I think it needs a little space. And I''m not personally keen on the rather blue colour tones of the image. I think warmer tones would suit it better.</td>', 'I like the scene you have set with the chair and framed image in the background. The plate feels too close to the edge of the image though, I think it needs a little space. And I''m not personally keen on the rather blue colour tones of the image. I think warmer tones would suit it better.', '2008-07-16 11:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828620, 698689, 45857, '<td valign="top">Sounds tasty, but the shrimp looks pale, perhaps a touch more saturation and contrast to bring up the grill marks.</td>', 'Sounds tasty, but the shrimp looks pale, perhaps a touch more saturation and contrast to bring up the grill marks.', '2008-07-16 11:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4828623, 698551, 59029, '<td valign="top">very yummy, can''t wait to read the recipe!</td>', 'very yummy, can''t wait to read the recipe!', '2008-07-16 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
