(4837743, 698293, 94876, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this was shot w./ a lensbaby or it was just blurred in PS, but I like it a lot.  It really places emphasis on the colors, which works well.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this was shot w./ a lensbaby or it was just blurred in PS, but I like it a lot.  It really places emphasis on the colors, which works well.', '2008-07-21 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
