(4837758, 699596, 94876, '<td valign="top">Clever, and with the sideways smile, too!  I like the overexposure on the center of the plate.  Puts real emphasis on teh expression.</td>', 'Clever, and with the sideways smile, too!  I like the overexposure on the center of the plate.  Puts real emphasis on teh expression.', '2008-07-21 23:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
