(4839960, 698691, 67697, '<td valign="top">What I loved about this was how simple it was.  The color is subtle and the onion looks comfortable in the surroundings.  (if an onion is capable of feeling comfortable)  I thought the diagonal really added a bit of drama and loved the clarity of the shot.  Great shot!</td>', 'What I loved about this was how simple it was.  The color is subtle and the onion looks comfortable in the surroundings.  (if an onion is capable of feeling comfortable)  I thought the diagonal really added a bit of drama and loved the clarity of the shot.  Great shot!', '2008-07-23 01:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
