(4841834, 698691, 45475, '<td valign="top">A neat little trick for slicing onions is to do it under running water to stop the vapours getting your eyes (um, just the onion... you don''t have to get in the shower - although it would make it a little more fun... or weird).<br/> <br/>Loved the tilt. Great light and clarity, definitely magazine quality too. That''s a good thing!</td>', 'A neat little trick for slicing onions is to do it under running water to stop the vapours getting your eyes (um, just the onion... you don''t have to get in the shower - although it would make it a little more fun... or weird). Loved the tilt. Great light and clarity, definitely magazine quality too. That''s a good thing!', '2008-07-23 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4841950, 699608, 29011, '<td valign="top">Your compositions are brilliant. It''s like an environmental food portrait. The way you incorporate things in to the image and not make it look too busy. Perhaps the lemons seem slightly out off place? are they normally eaten with friands?  Not your best food image but it''s very far from bad. Underrated for sure. A very nice addition to your portfolio.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-23 21:47:12.</i></td>', 'Your compositions are brilliant. It''s like an environmental food portrait. The way you incorporate things in to the image and not make it look too busy. Perhaps the lemons seem slightly out off place? are they normally eaten with friands?  Not your best food image but it''s very far from bad. Underrated for sure. A very nice addition to your portfolio.', '2008-07-23 22:44:50.000000', '2008-07-23 22:47:12.000000', 0),
